OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdamp and cloudy overnight, with rain
OL,7,Fsteadily easing by morning. Breezy at
OL,8,Ffirst, but strong winds later become
OL,9,Fconfined to north Devon coasts. Mild
OL,10,Fin the far southwest but chillier
OL,11,Felsewhere.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FMostly wet and cloudy to
OL,14,Fstart Wednesday, turning drier and
OL,15,Fclearer by the evening away from Devon
OL,16,Fand Cornwall. Feeling chilly with
OL,17,Fwinds picking up along coasts later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
