OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FPatchy frost and fog to start
OL,7,FThursday, but dry and bright after
OL,8,Fthis and into the weekend. Cold for
OL,9,Fthe time of year with brisk winds
OL,10,Fwhich ease later.
